      "lines": [
        "§5. 相等的分数"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "38. 分数的基本性质"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如图133所示，把圆分成四等份，其中两部分涂有阴影.",
        "两部分，即圆的$\\frac{2}{4}$. 因为阴影部分是圆的一半，所以圆的$\\frac{2}{4}$",
        "等于圆的$\\frac{1}{2}$. 因而分数$\\frac{2}{4}$和$\\frac{1}{2}$相等.",
        "$\\frac{2}{4}=\\frac{1}{2}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 133",
      "box": [
        419,
        1148,
        285,
        280
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-133"
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 134",
      "box": [
        729,
        1142,
        286,
        281
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-134"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 133",
      "box": null,
