      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图134"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果把圆的每四分之一再分成三等份（图134），整个圆",
        "就被分成12等份，有阴影部分是其中的6等份，就是，",
        "$\\frac{2}{4}=\\frac{6}{12}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\frac{2}{4}$的分子和分母同乘以3，可得$\\frac{6}{12}$：",
        "$\\frac{2}{4}=\\frac{2\\cdot3}{4\\cdot3}=\\frac{6}{12}$."
      ]
    },
